<title>USA: Bell Sports remains cautious on sales.</title>
<headline>Bell Sports remains cautious on sales.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Sports Corp said it will continue efforts to trim expenses and to increase gross margins in the third quarter, but remains cautious about the soft sales environment experienced in the second quarter.</p>
<p>Bell Sports reported net sales for the second quarter ended December 28 rose slightly to $56.6 million compared with $56.2 million in the comparable fiscal 1996 period.</p>
